  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854517), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14532972)  \n\n“I will not sacrifice my life to protect you. I will become invincible to protect you!” \n\nJang Cheon-Un, who lived as a back-alley thug after losing his bodyguard father, begins learning martial arts in his dreams every night after saving a dying old man. Caught up in a chance incident, he enters Gucheonseong, the greatest sect in the world. After enduring all kinds of contempt and grueling training, he becomes the bodyguard of the young lord, Sama Gyeong; however, the blades of conspiracy and betrayal surrounding the power of Gucheonseong are aimed at the young lord and Cheon-Un…",
